<title>NETHERLANDS: GTI H1 NET RISES TO 16.3 MILLION GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>GTI H1 NET RISES TO 16.3 MILLION GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First 24 weeks of 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise states)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  16.3     vs     9.5</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	 0.664   vs     0.692</p>
<p>    Financial income	   3.3     vs     2.9</p>
<p>    Profit on ord ops	 32.5     vs    26.8 </p>
<p>The company also said GTI Holding shares with a nominal value of 10 guilders, have been split on a five-for-one basis.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
